# GitHub's language bar counts bytes. The published builds kept for the
# migration tests and the page built from src/ would make the repository
# read as HTML; marked here, the bar counts the source (src/, scripts/,
# tests/). GitHub also folds a generated file's changes in a pull request,
# so index.html shows collapsed there. Nothing in the app or its tests reads
# this file.
baselines/*.html linguist-vendored
index.html linguist-generated
